              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "line1": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5-vw\">Technologies that promote safe care for mother and baby during childbirth</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">On World Patient Safety Day 2021, the World Health Organization (WHO) encourages the global community to ‘Act now for safe and respectful childbirth.<sup>1</sup>'&nbsp;To address this issue, we’re raising awareness of our Birthing Bed and Nära<b> </b>Bassinet, underscoring our commitment to create a safe environment for mother, baby and caregivers.</span></span></p>\r\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Sep 17 2021 14:18:50 GMT+0000",
